{"server":"kr","storyId":"story_kroos_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_kroos_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"사과","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"브릿지","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kroos_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"cad8a723652d1b4ec906a02e7d0d7c156dcd31e3ce1163f66b116822a955287c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"게으름 피우려는 사람은 항상 뜻밖의 일에 부딪히는 법.","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"어느 한가한 아침\n로도스 아일랜드 함선"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"어쩌다 보니 또 크루스한테 말려들었네……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"저기…… 팀장, 화내지 마세요. 크루스도 악의는 없었을 거예요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"어? 화난 거 아니야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"분명…… 내가 크루스 일하는 걸 보고 있었는데 어쩜 매번……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스는 단지 좀 더 쉬고 싶었을 뿐이에요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"다음에는 비글이 크루스를 감독해 줘. 그래도 비글 말은 듣는 것 같으니……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"에? 저도 딱히 한 건 없어요. 그냥 크루스가 일하는 걸 보는 것뿐인데요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스에게 일이 있으면 저도 같이 도와주긴 하는데, 조금 있으면 저한테 또 하지 말라고 그래요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"그게 끝이야? 모처럼 도와줬는데도?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"네…… 특별한 건 없어요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"역시 너답다. 비글."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"이유는 모르겠는데 크루스가 게으름을 피우려고 하면 난 항상 속아 넘어간다니까……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"어떤 날은 배가 아프다고 하고, 또 어떤 날은 도베르만 교관이 찾는다고 하고. 난 또 그걸 매번 믿고 있고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"내가 알아차릴 때쯤이면 이미 도망치고 없다니깐."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"휴……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"드디어 찾았다."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"도망치지 마!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"비글, 넌 저쪽을 막아!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"네! 알겠어요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"하아, 하아하아……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"크루스, 거기 서! 나랑 당직 서야지!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(조금 쉬어도 괜찮잖아~)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"거기 서!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(아, 팽은 어떻게 점점 더 빨라지는 거지?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(이러다 잡히겠는데.)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"씬 아가씨, 더 듣고 싶으신 곡이 있나요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"씬","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"응……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"알겠습니다. 렌즈가 음악 보관함에서 찾아보겠습니다."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(씬…… 인가?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(흠……)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"(좋아. 해보자.)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"얏호~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"아, 크루스 아가씨, 안녕하세요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"씬 옆에 앉아도 될까?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"음……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"씬 아가씨께서 상관없다고 하시네요. 앉으세요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"고마워~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"하아…… 후우……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스 아가씨, 힘드신가 보죠?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크루스","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"쿠란타한테 쫓기고 있으니까~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"렌즈","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"아, 저도 들었어요. 팽 아가씨네요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"크