"speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"화내는 게 아니야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"오늘 크루스가 도망갈 때 나한테 말했어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 말요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"오늘은 내가 모두의 리더가 된 기념일이니까, 나를 위해 선물을 사러 가고 싶다고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"그거 좋은 일이잖아요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"결국 크루스는 나가서 돌아오지 않았어. 네가 숙소로 돌아온 다음에 내가 알아차린 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"오늘, 진짜 기념일인가요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"물론이지……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"그건…… 크루스 씨가 지나치셨네요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"이따가 제가 혼내줄게요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"그래……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"아, 맞다! 기념일 축하해요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"아, 그래…… 고마워."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"방금 저거 크루스 아닌가요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"비글","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"내가 또 잘못 봤나……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"크루스 맞아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"팽","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"뭔가 급한 일이 있는 것 같아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"